<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pelopidas - 38,000 tonnes bulk dap Donaldsville/JNPT $30.75 fio 6,000/2,500 27/4-4/5 Indian government.</p>
<p>Space - 50,000 tonnes bulk urea Yuzhnny or Odessa/JNPT $23 fio 8,000/2,500 14-16/5 Indian government.</p>
<p>Laxmi - 25,000 tonnes bulk urea Shuaiba/India $14.50 fio 4,500/1,200 24-26/4 Indian government.</p>
<p>Lena II - 25,000 tonnes bulk urea Shuaiba/India $14.50 fio 4,500/1,200 1-5/5 Indian government.</p>
</text>
